{"slug":"ss-l-hh","ar":"ص ل ح","total":180,"core":"righteousness; reform; reconciliation","forms":[{"ar":"صَٰلِح","kind":"active participle","form":null,"count":65,"gloss":"righteous","word":null,"ex":{"s":37,"a":100,"p":5,"ar":["رَبِّ","هَبْ","لِى","مِنَ","ٱلصَّـٰلِحِينَ"],"en":"My Lord, grant me [a child] from among the righteous"}},{"ar":"صَّٰلِحَٰت","kind":"active participle","form":null,"count":62,"gloss":"Righteous deeds, good works","word":"salihat","ex":{"s":29,"a":9,"p":4,"ar":["وَٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوا۟","وَعَمِلُوا۟","ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ","لَنُدْخِلَنَّهُمْ","فِى","ٱلصَّـٰلِحِينَ"],"en":"And those who believe and do righteous deeds - We will surely admit them among the righteous [into Paradise]"}},{"ar":"أَصْلَحَ","kind":"verb","form":4,"count":28,"gloss":"to reform; to make peace","word":null,"ex":{"s":47,"a":5,"p":2,"ar":["سَيَهْدِيهِمْ","وَيُصْلِحُ","بَالَهُمْ"],"en":"He will guide them and amend their condition"}},{"ar":"صَٰلِح2","kind":"name","form":null,"count":9,"gloss":"Salih","word":null,"ex":{"s":26,"a":142,"p":5,"ar":["إِذْ","قَالَ","لَهُمْ","أَخُوهُمْ","صَـٰلِحٌ","أَلَا","تَتَّقُونَ"],"en":"When their brother Salih said to them, \"Will you not fear Allah"}},{"ar":"إِصْلَٰح","kind":"verbal noun","form":4,"count":7,"gloss":"reform, reconciliation","word":null,"ex":{"s":7,"a":56,"p":6,"ar":["وَلَا","تُفْسِدُوا۟","فِى","ٱلْأَرْضِ","بَعْدَ","إِصْلَـٰحِهَا","وَٱدْعُوهُ","خَوْفًا","وَطَمَعًا ۚ","إِنَّ","رَحْمَتَ","ٱللَّهِ","قَرِيبٌ","مِّنَ","ٱلْمُحْسِنِينَ"],"en":"And cause not corruption upon the earth after its reformation. And invoke Him in fear and aspiration. Indeed, the mercy of Allah is near to the doers of good"}},{"ar":"مُصْلِح","kind":"active participle","form":4,"count":5,"gloss":"reformer","word":null,"ex":{"s":11,"a":117,"p":8,"ar":["وَمَا","كَانَ","رَبُّكَ","لِيُهْلِكَ","ٱلْقُرَىٰ","بِظُلْمٍ","وَأَهْلُهَا","مُصْلِحُونَ"],"en":"And your Lord would not have destroyed the cities unjustly while their people were reformers"}},{"ar":"صَلَحَ","kind":"verb","form":1,"count":2,"gloss":"to be righteous","word":null,"ex":{"s":13,"a":23,"p":5,"ar":["جَنَّـٰتُ","عَدْنٍ","يَدْخُلُونَهَا","وَمَن","صَلَحَ","مِنْ","ءَابَآئِهِمْ","وَأَزْوَٰجِهِمْ","وَذُرِّيَّـٰتِهِمْ ۖ","وَٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةُ","يَدْخُلُونَ","عَلَيْهِم","مِّن","كُلِّ","بَابٍ"],"en":"Gardens of perpetual residence; they will enter them with whoever were righteous among their fathers, their spouses and their descendants. And the angels will enter upon them from every gate, [saying]"}},{"ar":"صُلْح","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":2,"gloss":"reconciliation","word":null,"ex":{"s":4,"a":128,"p":15,"ar":["وَإِنِ","ٱمْرَأَةٌ","خَافَتْ","مِنۢ","بَعْلِهَا","نُشُوزًا","أَوْ","إِعْرَاضًا","فَلَا","جُنَاحَ","عَلَيْهِمَآ","أَن","يُصْلِحَا","بَيْنَهُمَا","صُلْحًا ۚ","وَٱلصُّلْحُ","خَيْرٌ ۗ","وَأُحْضِرَتِ","ٱلْأَنفُسُ","ٱلشُّحَّ ۚ","وَإِن","تُحْسِنُوا۟","وَتَتَّقُوا۟","فَإِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","كَانَ","بِمَا","تَعْمَلُونَ","خَبِيرًا"],"en":"And if a woman fears from her husband contempt or evasion, there is no sin upon them if they make terms of settlement between them - and settlement is best. And present in [human] souls is stinginess. But if you do good and fear Allah - then indeed Allah is ever, with what you do, Acquainted"}}],"surahs":[[4,14],[7,13],[2,12],[11,9],[18,7],[5,6],[21,6],[3,5],[29,5],[22,4],[26,4],[27,4],[28,4],[42,4],[47,4],[6,3],[9,3],[10,3],[16,3],[19,3],[20,3],[24,3],[30,3],[34,3],[35,3],[40,3],[41,3],[45,3],[49,3],[12,2],[13,2],[17,2],[23,2],[25,2],[32,2],[33,2],[37,2],[38,2],[46,2],[65,2],[66,2],[8,1],[14,1],[31,1],[48,1],[63,1],[64,1],[68,1],[72,1],[84,1],[85,1],[95,1],[98,1],[103,1]]}